  "keyFeatures": [
    "LangSmith observability and tracing for AI agents and LLM applications",
    "Evaluation and testing with datasets, LLM-as-judge, and human feedback",
    "Prompt engineering with version control, playground, and collaboration",
    "One-click agent deployment with scalable infrastructure via Agent Server",
    "LangChain open-source framework with prebuilt agents and 100+ integrations",
    "LangGraph low-level graph orchestration with persistence and human-in-the-loop",
    "Deep Agents batteries-included agent with memory, subagents, and sandboxes",
    "LangSmith Fleet no-code agent builder for non-technical users",
    "Multi-framework tracing support (OpenAI, Anthropic, LangGraph, CrewAI, AutoGen, etc.)",
    "Self-hosted, hybrid, and cloud deployment options"
  ],
